      "prompt": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the curly auburn-haired woman in a mustard cardigan, cream blouse, dark jeans and brown boots, defined by <Picture 2> and <Picture 3>. Her voice is a warm natural mid-pitched adult female German voice.\n<Subject 2> is the older silver-haired, short-bearded man in navy work coveralls and brown work boots, defined by <Picture 4> and <Picture 5>. His voice is a calm low-pitched slightly rough adult male German voice.\n<Subject 3> is the same living room as <Picture 1>: pale-blue plank walls, green sofa and bookshelf on the left, window left of the closed white door, white fireplace and gold sunburst mirror on the right, red rug, rectangular wooden coffee table with exactly one white teapot. Warm afternoon light. Woman at the sofa side, man at fireplace side, facing each other across the table.\nsummary: They agree to leave for the lake the next morning.\nretention_analysis: Preserve both people, their clothing, their positions and the room. Preserve the single white teapot on the table and the closed white door. The two people remain standing on their respective sides of the table throughout.\ndetailed_description: Naturalistic live-action cinematic image, stable late-afternoon light, clean digital image. [Shot 1] Continue the actual preceding wide view, woman left at sofa, man right at fireplace, single teapot on the table. The man looks at her and says <d>[German] Morgen fahren wir zusammen zum See.</d> His lips match the words then close; she listens with closed lips.\nAt 00:05.000 [Shot 2] Cut to chest-up of the man from the main camera side: white fireplace and pale-blue wall behind him, warm afternoon light. His head and both eyes are turned distinctly toward SCREEN LEFT, toward the woman standing beside the sofa. His face stays in three-quarter profile toward her. She answers from her unchanged position <d>[German] Dann brechen wir früh auf.</d> The man listens with lips pressed together and nods.\nAt 00:09.000 [Shot 3] Cut to the same main wide, woman left beside sofa, man right beside fireplace, closed white door behind. The woman raises her right hand in a small open-palmed gesture toward the single teapot, keeping her hand clearly above the table without touching anything, then lowers her hand to her side and looks back at the man. He keeps his hands relaxed. They stay in the wide with the teapot clearly visible through the final seconds.\noverall_soundscape: Audible clear German dialogue, a little clothing movement when hands gesture, quiet interior. Voices belong only to the two visible people, one speaking at a time.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
